<%- include('partials/header') %>

<section class="beta-access-hero">
  <div class="container beta-access-grid">
    <div class="beta-access-copy">
      <span class="generator-eyebrow">Public beta access</span>
      <h1>Design first.<br>Pay nothing.</h1>
      <p>ClothingDesign is free while the browser mockup workflow is in public beta. Choose a garment, place artwork, review the shape, and export a transparent PNG.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="/tools/t-shirt-mockup-generator" class="btn btn-primary btn-large">Start a T-shirt mockup</a>
        <a href="/mockups" class="btn btn-secondary btn-large">Browse all models</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <aside class="beta-access-card" aria-label="Free beta access details">
      <div class="beta-access-price"><strong>$0</strong><span>during public beta</span></div>
      <ul>
        <li><span>01</span> Browse the complete public 3D garment library</li>
        <li><span>02</span> Test garment color and artwork placement</li>
        <li><span>03</span> Review front, side, and back presentation angles</li>
        <li><span>04</span> Export a transparent PNG mockup</li>
      </ul>
      <p>No payment details are requested. Cloud project storage, collaboration, and paid team plans are not currently offered.</p>
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="beta-access-note">
  <div class="container beta-access-note-grid">
    <div>
      <span class="generator-eyebrow">Clear expectations</span>
      <h2>Mockup-ready, not production-spec CAD.</h2>
    </div>
    <p>Use exports for product-page drafts, POD planning, client review, and launch decks. Confirm dimensions, fabric behavior, and manufacturing requirements with your production partner.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
